{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "ce8efa82e4969ab51fb3edd0fff0c0f632445be3bfe136aa07d0113909a54040", "ja": "ふおおおおおっ！　アイドルちゃんだらけの劇場、\nそれはまさしくこの世の桃源郷……！", "zh": "呜哦哦哦哦哦！满是偶像美少女的剧场，\n简直就是人间仙境……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "1f25a9c7620bbaf46ff7419de3dec90d11a077a7b32135bd664ad63c339883ab", "ja": "この高性能一眼レフで、劇場のみんなの魅力を\n余さず収めてみせますよぉ！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "用这台高性能单反相机，把剧场里大家的魅力一丝不漏地全部拍下来给您看哦！呜呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "60e362af5438049bd75338825b4ca9db50762915951beebef55a2b9b9d87b8c5", "ja": "（……どうしよう）", "zh": "（……怎么办。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ef7ef325d6d9d814ebfc9f6a225c25668d69e0c116f0fbce5736bcf251baca83", "ja": "（外出するって言いに来たんだけど、聞かなかったこと\nにした方がいいのか……。ええいっ、ままよ！）", "zh": "（我是来告知要出门的，可要不要就当作没听见算了……。不管了，豁出去了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1004_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7c95f1ad7004558dbb1c08614f2f6bc32e15e9a89395230edbfcb3312b83bb99", "ja": "お疲れさまです。……あれれ？　おかしいなー？\n亜利沙の声がしたはずなのにー？", "zh": "辛苦了。……咦咦？奇怪了——？\n刚才明明听到了亚利沙的声音——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "679f67deb31aa39ee9ad3484b9a093cb058e974662b8898db660ce6a7e00a249", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nえへへっ、そんなに似てました？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿，刚才模仿得很像吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "eadd271f8b9ac817e589d1758fe9959e0740f8c4f268be7694eb5520032b6d07", "ja": "じつは！　今のは、写真を上手に撮れるようになりたい\n私が、亜利沙ちゃんのモノマネをしてたんです♪", "zh": "其实！刚才是想要学会拍出好照片的我，在模仿亚利沙♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d9244c22f75951db0c0f18b0748d237cf075326e62b5fd586da4317895128947", "ja": "写真を撮るために……。\nそうでしたか……。", "zh": "为了拍照……  \n原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "ebeed4466f328839d1719c7ce27c6ace7f208882fc27f120014fbceb33e1e9a8", "ja": "そうなんです♪", "zh": "就是这样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "215c3e09e56773595979751a056dadd26ef5a4ed90550b2b030c02f4a0f3bc41", "ja": "えっと……あの、青羽さん。", "zh": "那个……青羽小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a1f8e17a10133876509bba76fd5e7e4abf82dab719df5ed9e6896c54ce8af636", "ja": "でしたら、もしかしたら、\n千早の真似でもいけるかもしれません。", "zh": "这样的话，说不定模仿千早也行得通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "b22a801f9e61e6f2efda4455cf16413fbfbd58bc0365ddb487a666eff258fb11", "ja": "あ！　確かに、千早ちゃんもよく写真を撮って\nいますもんね！　いいアイディアかも♪", "zh": "啊！确实，千早也经常在拍照\n呢！可能是个好主意哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e2bfe9067170dec8f237d6b6066b872dc5daeeff9718539dedffc1950aee788e", "ja": "検討してみてください。あ、それと社長に呼ばれてる\nので、事務所に打ち合わせに行ってきますね。では！", "zh": "请考虑一下。啊，对了，社长叫我过去，我要去事务所开会了。那我先走啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "98bb66d79f4b48a24edcac14dc2d491166af05e86cc20ce22b10fc025bdcbf14", "ja": "はーい！　いってらっしゃ～い♪\nそっか、千早ちゃんの真似かぁ～。よーし……。", "zh": "好——！路上小心～♪\n原来如此，是在模仿千早啊～。好，那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "54b6cb2f07612327d358777498c62a756e4b35ae071920a402774b107929b7f4", "ja": "お疲れ様です。如月千早です。\nでは……写真を1枚、よろしいですか？　ふふっ。", "zh": "辛苦了。我是如月千早。\n那么……请拍1张照片，可以吗？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "9b7d38533512b1b5b123204daf5fef809d53c6a189b99210b2f39cc178084fb2", "ja": "わ。なんだか、いい写真が撮れそう～～！", "zh": "哇。感觉能拍出很棒的照片呢～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1018_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "545f69088b0a25b0f422048ce9c2706021d29cf6ab716b4336b2e0f059b65a58", "ja": "お疲れさまです。今日の打ち合わせは次の\n『BATTLE OF THEATER』についてですよね。", "zh": "辛苦了。今天的会议是要讨论接下来的\n《BATTLE OF THEATER》，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1241244717d4c1daabaa17d6c5b06d6329356f930b601a6de51a845cc5918ca8", "ja": "じつはまだ、まとまりきっていないんです。\nいくつか案はあるんですが……。", "zh": "其实还没完全定下来。\n虽然有几个方案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "80a00a61bd40889bd4ca7b609d32680e6719eec938be6372dfbb8640497282b1", "ja": "なぁに、それを詰めていくための会議じゃないか。\n気にすることはない。", "zh": "这不就是为了把这些细节敲定下来而开的会议吗。  \n不用在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "cda1d46a76bb8e0246653d8a282e75b98feaf8b19a6252fa39dc6795522bca2d", "ja": "ただ、今ちょっと急ぎの別件があってね。\n少しの間、待っててもらえるかな？", "zh": "不过，我这边刚好有件急事。能稍微等我一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4eb538430f554fe67c6e9cb180f5aa8b30122739ab0444e70bfa02e39831c741", "ja": "はい、それは大丈夫ですが……\n別件ですか？", "zh": "嗯，没问题，但是……\n是别的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "adaf92ea540db2c38572c43a5b9ec97b813f46d3559d322830ac4b1ca9a84f58", "ja": "社長、お知り合いの芸能事務所の方から、\n頼まれ事をされてるんです。", "zh": "社长，有位您认识的艺能事务所的人，\n拜托了我一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "30c8a99782259bddd203e43b604cc240933ba662cde4771ba66c36d345d1ab77", "ja": "入所希望者たちの書類に目を通して、\n感想を聞かせてくれないかって。", "zh": "希望入所者们的资料，您能过目一下，再告诉我您的看法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3a34ccbd4b8880788a3e1493908d9421e752bf304e3e2757678f6f6dd500d26c", "ja": "あ、なるほど……。\n社長の人を見る目は確かですもんね。", "zh": "啊，原来如此……\n社长看人的眼光确实很准呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "e4823cbf26659a1931124f75375c6648787b386f68199a1099a4179c674edcab", "ja": "はっはっは、いやぁ、私がピンときた子を教えるだけで\nいいと言われて、断れなくてねぇ～。", "zh": "哈哈哈，哎呀，人家说只要告诉他们让我觉得有感觉的孩子就行，我也不好拒绝嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "b65c49b2e93e141d79fe441814aa1d1e9ac6e569ddc50f3b64e1bec63fcd1b8e", "ja": "そうだ、君の意見も聞かせてくれたまえ。\n若くフレッシュな視点も大事だからね。", "zh": "对了，也请让我听听你的意见。\n年轻而新鲜的视角也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "1c6304896e37a0f30cc27d3c424b2c06c9b1add09d07f162995a5d5f2321f794", "ja": "あ、それじゃあ私も……ふむふむ。履歴書の写真\nだけじゃなくて、自撮りもあるんですね。", "zh": "啊，这样的话，我也来看看……嗯嗯。不只是简历上的照片，还有自拍照啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "7a8b427a370f1635ce113bdd6bcc2c2db347ac6f5f7e05d7e01cc202ac9aa46a", "ja": "SNSアカウントも申告してもらっているよ。\nこういった自己表現も大切な時代だからね。", "zh": "社交账号也都有让他们申报哦。\n毕竟在当下这个时代，这种自我表达也很重要嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "be30352406686ed87a63b2e028cfc7cfbbe130ae5013bf5db521e5028f078c5b", "ja": "この手の自己表現はいまや必須ですね。\nみんな、本当に上手に撮るなぁ……あ！", "zh": "这种自我表现如今已经是必需的了。大家真的都很会拍啊……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_1032", "source_sha256": "2c355462a9113e5fbc9ce7241bac947c6bf5fa817432a62ef58a39fbd6387757", "ja": "ピンときた", "zh": "灵光一现", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "7254969ee1a050db385d65c996bd398f37bcdaac1fc62a90570c2517dd369a2a", "ja": "ピンときました。今回のBOT、\n写真対決をするのはどうでしょうか。", "zh": "我想到了。这次的BOT，要不要来场摄影对决？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "e31469b40ffd72dbf2e69230cde66599bf84ee871bffdc21eb0d77389d5dc26a", "ja": "なるほど！　自己主張、自己表現としての\n写真で対決、というわけだね！", "zh": "原来如此！也就是说，要用照片来一决高下，展现自我主张和自我表达！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "7b44d260adad65a72c6f4e1e06875de89e30b2c8aa6d46fcd81aac5079c90c03", "ja": "SNSの流行も踏まえた、自己肯定感を\nアゲちゃう自分の一枚……素敵だと思います！", "zh": "既顺应了社交平台的流行趋势，又能提升自我肯定感的\n自己的一张照片……我觉得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "43f3a0dc6ea0dc860764dee115618c7f4fc8e9163313f1151a85b185bf3bdc10", "ja": "うむ、さすがは私が見込んだプロデューサーだ。\nそのアイディアで企画をまとめてくれたまえ！", "zh": "嗯，不愧是我看中的制作人。\n就用那个点子把企划整理出来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
